  "Click the \"UI Editor\" icon in the upper right corner to enter the UI Editor mode": "點擊右上角的“介面配置”图标，进入介面配置模式",
  "Specifies a Permissions Policy for the <iframe>. The policy defines what features are available to the <iframe> (for example, access to the microphone, camera, battery, web-share, etc.) based on the origin of the request.": "用于为 <iframe> 指定其權限策略。该策略根据請求的来源规定 <iframe> 可以使用哪些特性（例如，访问麦克风、摄像头、电池、web 共用等）。",
  "Controls whether the current document is allowed to autoplay media requested through the HTMLMediaElement interface. When this policy is disabled and there were no user gestures, the Promise returned by HTMLMediaElement.play() will reject with a NotAllowedError DOMException. The autoplay attribute on <audio> and <video> elements will be ignored.": "控制是否允許目前檔案自動播放媒体。这种控制是通過介面 HTMLMediaElement 来实现。当这种規則被停用，而且沒有使用者操作的時候，HTMLMediaElement.play() 返回的 Promise 会拒絕并抛出一个 DOMException 例外。<audio> 和 <video> 上的 autoplay 属性会被忽略。",
  "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use video input devices. When this policy is disabled, the Promise returned by getUserMedia() will reject with a NotAllowedError DOMException.": "控制是否允許目前檔案使用影片输入裝置。当这种規則被停用時，MediaDevices.getUserMedia() 返回的 Promise 会拒絕并抛出 NotAllowedError DOMException 例外。",
  "Controls whether the current document is allowed to set document.domain. When this policy is disabled, attempting to set document.domain will fail and cause a SecurityError DOMException to be thrown.": "控制是否允許目前檔案設定 document.domain。当这种規則被停用時，尝试設定 document.domain 会失敗并抛出 SecurityError DOMException 例外。",
  "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Encrypted Media Extensions API (EME). When this policy is disabled, the Promise returned by Navigator.requestMediaKeySystemAccess() will reject with a SecurityError DOMException.": "控制是否允許目前檔案使用 Encrypted Media Extension API（EME）。当这种規則被停用時，Navigator.requestMediaKeySystemAccess() 返回的 Promise 会拒絕并抛出 DOMException 例外。",
  "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use Element.requestFullscreen(). When this policy is disabled, the returned Promise rejects with a TypeError.": "控制是否允許目前檔案使用 Element.requestFullScreen()。当这种規則被停用時，返回的 Promise 会拒絕并抛出 TypeError。",
  "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Geolocation Interface. When this policy is disabled, calls to getCurrentPosition() and watchPosition() will cause those functions callbacks to be invoked with a GeolocationPositionError code of PERMISSION_DENIED.": "控制是否允許目前檔案使用 Geolocation 介面。当这种規則被停用時，呼叫 getCurrentPosition() 和 watchPosition() 会返回套件含 PERMISSION_DENIED 的 PositionError。",
  "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use audio input devices. When this policy is disabled, the Promise returned by MediaDevices.getUserMedia() will reject with a NotAllowedError DOMException.": "控制是否允許目前檔案使用音訊输入裝置。当这种規則被停用時，MediaDevices.getUserMedia() 返回的 Promise 会拒絕并抛出錯誤 NotAllowedError。",
  "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Web MIDI API. When this policy is disabled, the Promise returned by Navigator.requestMIDIAccess() will reject with a SecurityError DOMException.": "控制是否允許目前檔案使用 Web MIDI API。当这种規則被停用時，Navigator.requestMIDIAccess() 返回的 Promise 会拒絕并抛出錯誤 DOMException。",
  "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Payment Request API. When this policy is enabled, the PaymentRequest() constructor will throw a SecurityError DOMException.": "控制是否允許目前檔案使用 Payment Request API。当这种規則被啟用時，构造函式 PaymentRequest() 会抛出錯誤 SecurityError。",
  "After successful submission, the selected data blocks will be automatically refreshed.": "提交成功后，会自動重新整理这里選取的資料区块。",
